Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================
; Disable Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling for Windowed Apps
; Windows 11 Gaming Optimization Guide
; Source: FR33THYFR33THY/Ultimate — 5 Graphics/13 Hags Windowed.ps1
; Copyright FR33THY (MIT)
; ============================================================
; Tier: Advanced
;
; HAGS (Hardware-Accelerated GPU Scheduling) is fine for fullscreen
; games but can introduce input latency for windowed / borderless
; games on some configs. This tweak disables HAGS for windowed
; presentation only — leaves it on for true exclusive fullscreen.
;
; If you experience input latency in borderless titles after enabling
; HAGS in Windows Settings, try this.
;
; Pair: revert-hags-windowed.reg
; ============================================================

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\GraphicsDrivers]
"DirectFlipDisabled"=dword:00000001
